{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:00 2026-11-23 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖老婆移美生活崩潰？Lisa S.因一事躁底鬧爆LA  大讚內地生活極之方便：真係好想念\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/0a17119c09792ee18c1de60c507c51b0/2026-11/Copy_of_KF__120.png\"/>\n<p>吳彥祖與名模老婆Lisa S.結婚多年，育有愛女吳斐然（Raven），近年一家三口定居美國。雖然吳彥祖經常忙於拍戲，但Lisa S.依然將家庭照顧得井井有條，而且她更是愛馬之人，一有空閒便會駕車前往馬場探望她的馬匹。不過日前Lisa S.上載了一段去馬場的日常短片，片中她竟然一改平日優雅大方的形象，一邊揸車一邊忍不住大發脾氣，原來當地交通擠塞問題非常嚴重，令她感到無比煩躁，忍不住當場抱怨：「點解洛杉磯會變成咁？每個人表現到好似佢哋第一日揸車咁！我哋喺呢度去邊都要揸車，真係好無奈！」</p>\n<h2>Lisa S.掛念中國叫外賣方便</h2>\n<p>Lisa S.雖然揸車揸到一肚火，更自嘲去馬場要塞足7個鐘，但當抵達馬場，見到心愛的馬匹時，Lisa S.的心情隨即平復。而提到平日點外賣的繁瑣，她更突然大讚中國的生活便利，表示十分懷念在中國的日子，特別是極之方便的外送服務。Lisa S.在片中興奮地跟朋友對話，更笑言：「如果我哋喺中國，直接用『美團』點外賣就得啦！外賣好快就會送到我門口，仲要好方便！真係希望我之前喺中國嘅時候就知有咁便利嘅功能，不過算啦，我以前都係叫朋友幫我點。」</p>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖與 Lisa S. 結婚多年恩愛依舊，近年更被網民大讚極具「夫妻相」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8c6c2ab3f69beda8496cf88d9bb8f9e1/2026-11/wne05p01141213.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖與Lisa. S非常恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fcb2404ba1d22abe04f8df7ba42e41f/2023-07/thatdanielwu_310185322_611502010645447_5229680011817656517_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖與太太​是圈中的模範夫婦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aac20d4753e733231503eaf5fa5cadb0/2023-07/34412693_403676093482254_4101028769303625728_n_164866316562b428d0ad4a5-1024x1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩人外形相當匹配。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62ac48c00bd2506fb60bcb08aaf94d02/2023-07/thelisa_s_77214274_169085604484420_3582335377992516821_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近日Lisa S. 揸車發脾氣兼咬牙切齒，鬧爆洛杉磯司機：「點解好似第一日學車咁？」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6156375f2b58a944896c5ced6bf094a/2026-11/VS---rednote-0_22__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Lisa S. 無奈直言在當地去哪裡都必須開車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0edf5af8e75a75b7ef30c40e2f576801/2026-11/VS---rednote-0_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一提起中國外賣服務，Lisa S. 隨即轉怒為喜，大讚美團超級便利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c8c1f06bd7b3920ba9014abb5396fd1/2026-11/VS---rednote-1_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Lisa S. 笑言如果自己在中國，一定天天用美團叫外賣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87ebf49833e5806c948c8b1e9a2728ad/2026-11/VS---rednote-1_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Lisa S. 得知外國手機號碼也能直接點美團，直呼這是外國人的神級功能。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7af5042a8599d6dc12f1168224e11f5/2026-11/VS---rednote-1_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"歷經足足「7個小時」的漫長車程，Lisa S. 終於順利抵達馬場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/881a06690fce9f66d64df565d3cf2ccf/2026-11/VS---rednote-1_59_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"雖然路途遙遠，但能展開每日的馬場療癒流程，仍令 Lisa S. 感到十分滿足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b75163a0cf9575a4780d6fc162a5f7d4/2026-11/VS---rednote-2_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Lisa S. 換上專業裝束英姿颯爽，直言為了愛馬，塞車再久也絕對值得。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59004bc4696aa8b1885175567df93b7f/2026-11/VS---rednote-2_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖在美國也會帶老婆Lisa S.出席不同活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2ecca7a52f072f49e80448356bfa337/2022-10/family%20%283%29_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖於疫情期間曾爆出過「無性婚姻」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4bc256c2565f96705c9941fd77035cbe/2023-07/192118795_961957964558720_2494026586672016494_n_40824922462b428da169df-1024x1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖的女兒於2013年出世。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/738d70a2e8cc778cc7518a652e555481/2023-07/120094643_3236446989764570_7707977139811095053_n_137286803862b428d62eb70-820x1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖感激女兒Raven為帶來歡樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/960d4cdd8cd0833f7dbc64a549b979ed/2023-07/thatdanielwu_350239994_4201321590093023_1951754121743781492_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖一家三口好幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8c88a241a2fcb3a77a366888054cd41/2023-05/daniel_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖近年與老婆Lisa S.和囡囡定居美國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82188550022e9ad2b37a70bc96200bb0/2022-10/family%20%281%29_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖間中分享與女兒的生活點滴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a36a2647c4d766e9d635a7f682e5262a/2023-07/37827328_515264275578098_2361722552369283072_n_38644097562b428d26d212-1024x1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熱愛騎馬的Lisa. S曾帶女兒試騎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eac834cf3e87820bf901a0b90c8d9a1c/2023-07/thelisa_s_14279026_1190803147647098_1790404616_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖於2022年帶出妻女出席《西部世界》首映禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2edea4cfe677311a81e6db5af13c430b/2022-10/family%20%282%29_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖兩父女的日常生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5407c8d0421298dbb261a2d134550420/2023-05/daniel_34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖一家曾去日本玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd455c7a8979d0722e96d2a198c76ff1/2023-07/thelisa_s_344367811_642423627696226_9184662976103992496_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Lisa. S與名模好友陳嘉容及Ana. R聚會，並帶同女兒Raven出席。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bcc6cb532a50254ea73e17e2663f5b64/2023-07/eunis818_361621303_18377074327052335_8657476372773575698_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖則帶同女兒，與李璨琛及關秀媚前男友李煒尚敘舊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bddcf0a4bffdf0e04103fec55db7b1a6/2023-07/9_600.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖一家三口與友人入場睇《第66屆美國格林美音樂奬頒獎典禮》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bc35b1b58f79b7f379bdf27736c69a38/2024-02/Daniel_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖的囡囡越大越似媽媽Lisa S.。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c9e91d59279d73d860a8750dcfdc3e0/2024-02/Daniel_1_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>吳彥祖曾暗示與Lisa S.多年無性生活</h2>\n<p>事實上，吳彥祖與Lisa S.自2010年結婚至今已走過十多個年頭，二人早已是老夫老妻。雖然吳彥祖曾自嘲結婚多年「生殖器可能是全身最乾淨的地方」，疑似暗示過無性婚姻，但兩夫妻一向恩愛，生活幸福美滿。近年不少網民發現，Lisa S.與老公吳彥祖越來越有「夫妻相」，甚至有人指她高得離譜的髮線跟老公一模一樣，笑言二人「女生男相」卻愈顯恩愛。</p>\n<img alt=\"鄭保瑞執導的《九龍城寨之終章》早前在尖東一帶封街拍外景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e93cba8516a44d2b2e7518bf21e80096/2026-05/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-21_at_13_54_42_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖現身拍攝現場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6168f0db3d2f549a9c58425e77a18c8e/2026-05/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-21_at_13_54_42.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖其光頭兇悍造型首度曝光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/234cec72632bfdaaa41b35b2e4aba34a/2026-05/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-21_at_13_54_44.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖在夜總會門外以一敵三。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/212e625b55db786bb3dda15d03d30034/2026-05/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-21_at_13_54_46.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖擔任內地滑雪品牌的代言人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4148a368d55e1c56f60660b8b1a8c584/2026-11/002yJFiggy1ij8f3idz2ij644j66px6w02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖在社交平台分享滑雪品牌的使用心得。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca1b7ae9d8ff4f6123a7e686d8fdef4c/2026-11/002yJFiggy1ij8f31ouhfj643x65rnpk02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖早前拍攝內地綜藝節目《狂想之城》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d08062b8a44332d54fe38b87825fd9dc/2026-11/VS---0_25__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖早前參加中國超級跑車錦標賽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94ffa36353b1cc64ea3e17007ba57cf3/2026-11/VS--ChinaGTChampionship-rednote-0_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖擔任內地梳化品牌代言，拍片介紹產品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab8e9fd7aa09a0fabbbdd3633bd0eced/2026-11/VS---rednote-2_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖女兒驚喜入鏡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9de52f3098aca4b4c21b1c4577615289/2026-06/VS--Icantbelievemybabyjustturned1313LisaSAB--0_53_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Lisa S.為囡囡的朋友留宿做準備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea29435f3f73452390ddae252cc74271/2026-06/VS--Icantbelievemybabyjustturned1313LisaSAB--1_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Lisa S.正在布置氣墊床。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87c12b53d56bd96ad2b0d6543292330f/2026-06/VS--Icantbelievemybabyjustturned1313LisaSAB--1_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"片中可看到室內環境，以原木設計為主。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe402b27e2cd6148ed59b72926d08236/2026-06/VS--Icantbelievemybabyjustturned1313LisaSAB--1_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Lisa S.的狗狗都有出場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf346482dd8fc5f4a1a3f6066eab4923/2026-06/VS--Icantbelievemybabyjustturned1313LisaSAB--1_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖指整個設計融入了五行元素；金、木、水、水、土，風水格局明顯。 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a079447e665bbf0c9b35b5857d57c9f9/2025-03/90dc1773-7eba-459e-aec1-7ddad13fbfbc.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖表示：「但這些小物件和裝飾有些是我女兒的創作。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/353a95720581a944036529ac2730dbf3/2025-03/e45bbe47-14b4-4cae-a72d-c26d6750c027.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖指中島位置是家中的核心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c67ac9f2441bcf67728a277e466b41a/2025-03/4d225e81-5286-49eb-9889-002c7933f0a9.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"主卧室的設計亦是以簡潔為主，牆身、雙人床和床頭櫃都是白色系。 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50f99da82e1fa462a5aaa3f4f408801a/2025-03/029ed06b-dc2d-47cd-aafa-00010c538ae2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"洗手間有大型鏡子、兩個洗手盤，浴缸也是白色系。 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08ecd7d691bd1929c62af521453163a5/2025-03/40c322d0-fbb5-45a2-8fe4-e83ca1f5153b.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳彥祖表示進入這座房子後，會看到有一道牆，把庭院和街道隔開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c43a967be17dee259d86d94929e6bd5/2025-03/b3aae9d6-f87c-437e-ab08-5dc7ce0984c3.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:32:42.822955+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":695,"images":48,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:00:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:36:51.921852+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:13.402935+00:00","content_hash":"ccefcf3a26960617dba0019647de18251eeae03441e13dcc76b21a0f58369ee4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}